    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "text": "(Whisper) Did the girl not realize she was walking in circles around the same wall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "text": "(Whisper) Not everyone has night vision. Say, I think I've seen her before."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "text": "(Whisper) She was in that art community yesterday... should we leave her here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "text": "(Whisper) I think her friends will come for her. I'll wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "text": "(Whisper) Alright, I'll look elsewhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "text": "(Mm... he's heavy.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "text": "(I should have stuffed you in the cupboard with the other poor bastard.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "text": "(Why would people from that neighborhood be here? This doesn't make sense.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "text": "(*sigh*...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "text": "(What's that noise?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "text": "(Hm?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Doc holds his breath and reaches for his weapon. Auditory senses are sharpened in darkness. The dragging sound grows ever closer."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sound from Loudspeakers",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "text": "So many times, brushing past each other♪"
