      "text": "Shuhrat!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The only light in the darkness is from Tecno's Arts, not bright enough to illuminate the whole warehouse, but just enough for everyone to see each other's faces.\nGazes cross and scan around, reading the same thing on the assembled faces—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "text": "(Whisper) Well, this is awkward... how did we end up here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "Maybe we can exchange hostages and each go our own way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno & Ela",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Wait!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "text": "What are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "We have to find out who's been using this warehouse for smuggling. What about you, girl?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "text": "Looking for the meds we lost."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "text": "We've already said we didn't steal the meds."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "Really? Then what are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "I told you, we're trying to find out who's smuggling stuff into this warehouse. What about you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "I said, this is where our meds are!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "You people are just impossible!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hey, anybody home? Your stuff's here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Man, all the way out in the middle of nowhere..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Everyone",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "So... if we all want to know what's up with that shipment of meds, why don't we ask the guy who's delivering it?"
    },
